      "role": "user",
      "content": "s3:PutObject Receipt?? i've never heard of that one. is that a real permission or did i just misread the docs? \n\ni tried adding the /* to the ARN and everything, but it's still being weird. i'm starting to feel like this thing is just actively working against me. it's like there's some invisible barrier or something preventing it from working even when the syntax looks okay. \n\ncan you double check if there's anything else i might be missing? maybe something about the s3 prefix or the way the lambda is authenticated? i just want to get this working so i can move on.",
      "source": "evaluator"
